{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Naked, and they were not ashamed.</b> For then all their actions and all their bodily members served solely to do their Maker's will, not to attain perishable pleasures at all — so that the act of conjugal union was to them like the act of eating and drinking for sustenance. And accordingly, those members were to them as the mouth, the face, and the hands are to us."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:45.413572840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}